mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444630/extras/18b469eea40b756cb6f262b9505d23b8.mp4?t=1750768693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful Staff, Seamless Service</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire NPC staff to help with orders and payments, giving you more time to grow your seafood restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444630/extras/132660b31f75eaf8d1a542ec3d2f9338.poster.avif?t=1750768693\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444630/extras/132660b31f75eaf8d1a542ec3d2f9338.webm?t=1750768693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444630/extras/132660b31f75eaf8d1a542ec3d2f9338.mp4?t=1750768693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're cooking for fun or chasing perfection, Coastal Kitchen Simulator invites you to be the seafood master.</p>",
